 ],
 "notes": "Buckets are not identified by name (not stated). Region split and policy attachment accepted via declared forms since provider-aliased resources and ARN-bearing policies may plan as unknown. secondary_region accepts a declared provider/region meta-argument on a bucket because older plans omit the planned region attribute; that branch cannot prove the aliased provider is in a different region (Partial, kept). Lifecycle checks require the stated 7-day GLACIER transition and 30-day expiration (declared-text branches that accepted any days were removed). delete_markers no longer accepts IAM s3:* text as evidence. Replication role trust requires sts:AssumeRole with the exact s3.amazonaws.com principal (logging.s3.amazonaws.com does not count). env_var is detail (a named configuration variable, not the point of the scenario). Candidate review: GLM53F omits the log-delivery-write ACL (uses a logging.s3 bucket policy instead); kept failing because the prompt states the ACL."
}